# Compiled Go binaries produced by `make build`
/build/

# Staged by `make generate` from src/python/hmd_cli_neuronsphere/services/.
# Not committed: the Python package is the one source of truth for these.
/internal/bundled/services/

# Packed by `make generate` from this module's own sources.
/internal/bundled/image/

# Packed by `make generate` from the repo classes' published `build` artifacts.
# Not committed: they are fetched, and .artifacts/ below is where they land.
/internal/bundled/repos/

# Repo trees fetched by tools/repopack, keyed <class>@<version>. Survives
# `make clean`; `make clean-artifacts` discards it.
/.artifacts/
